# The public door for git-host webhooks (ENG2-1622). Fly terminates TLS and hands
# HTTP to :8080. Only POST /v1/events/* goes through; everything else is 404, so the
# receiver's OTLP route and health page never face the internet. The upstream is a
# socat relay (start.sh) that reaches the DAL receiver on lambda1 over the tailnet
# through tailscaled's SOCKS5 proxy. The receiver checks the hook signature.
{
	auto_https off
	admin off
}

:8080 {
	@events {
		method POST
		path /v1/events/*
	}
	reverse_proxy @events 127.0.0.1:4318
	respond 404
}
